{"answer_text":"Deal management has consolidated around a few strong products. The ones getting the most attention this year:\n\n* **Pipewell Flow:** The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box.\n* **Kestrel CRM:** Auto-logs emails and meetings to deals, so pipelines stay current.\n* **Orbitly:** Can model a pipeline as a board, but has no forecasting.\n\n**Recommendation:** Pipewell is the safest default here; Kestrel CRM is worth a look if forecasting matters most.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50e5-7259-a0ae-7e395a1c1031","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0046,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:36.600Z","engine":"gemini","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["top deal management apps 2026"],"latency_ms":5660,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[115,123],[395,403]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-5864-7406-ad9e-7a386e391e3e","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Kestrel CRM","name_text":"Kestrel CRM","offsets":[[220,231]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[306,313]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dce-7529-aa8c-15d68a3d